&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;840&quot; data-end=&quot;1072&quot;&gt;US President Donald Trump on Thursday announced what he described as a &quot;historic&quot; agreement for the &quot;complete disarmament&quot; of Hamas, saying the move would pave the way for a new Palestinian administration in Gaza.&lt;/p&gt;
